{"type": "sena", "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"template_override": 1, "type": "welcome", "_data": [], "contents": [{}], "id": 0}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "type": "audio", "title": "", "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"audiosrc": "engenn9le13ob09re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn9le13ob09re2img06.jpg", "images": [{"image": "engenn9le13ob09re2img06.jpg", "text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0"}, {"image": "engenn9le13ob09re2img06.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Grant</span>: So how's life been treating you, buddy?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\"> Adam</span>: Alright, I guess. I'm working pretty hard looking for a job.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Grant</span>: Oh, we've all been there. I'm going to an interview next week.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\"> Adam </span>: It's really tough. I've done so many interviews, I could write an instruction manual about how to do them. I will be going to a few more interviews in the next few weeks.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Grant</span>: Problem is, you haven't been successful at getting a job. I'm not sure your manual would be a best-seller.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\"> Adam </span>: Oh, get out of here! I've learned a lot of good tips and tricks for doing interviews. When is yours?<br>", "id": 1, "time": "100"}, {"image": "engenn9le13ob09re2img05.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Grant</span>: I have an interview next Wednesday. I could really use some help.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\"> Adam </span>: Well, the first thing you have to do is do research about the company.  You'll learn about the structure and purpose of the company. You'll also see how they set themselves apart from others. You'll impress the interviewer if you give some reasons why you want to work there. I'm going to do a lot more research before my next interview. <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Grant</span>: That makes sense. In my last interview, they asked me why I wanted to work there instead of somewhere else. I didn't know what to say.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\"> Adam</span>: The next thing is to find out as much as you can about the role. Some recruiters asked me if I thought the job advertisement was misleading. They explained that the person writing the job description was often not the person you work for. It's possible you will be doing something quite different in the role.<br>", "id": 2, "time": "33250"}, {"image": "engenn9le13ob09re2img07.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Grant</span>: That's interesting.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\"> Adam</span>: Thirdly, it sounds a bit clich\u00e9, but you really have to know your strengths and weaknesses. Employers want you to be self-aware. You have to take a long hard look at what you have achieved, the way you have achieved that result, and the skills you developed along the way. This helps you understand what you're good at. It gives you confidence.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Grant</span>: Sold! I'll be the first person to buy a copy of your manual.  When I finish reading it, I will have learned everything I need to know about doing interviews!<br>", "id": 3, "time": "83000"}]}}], "id": 1}], "exercises": [{"template_override": 1, "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"content": " I can discuss future plans. ", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can report what someone had previously said.  ", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can explain how to be successful in an interview.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " Have you ever had an interview that went badly? What happened? ", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": " What are your strengths and weaknesses?", "type": "Free Header Item"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"content": "Welcome", "type": "group_name"}]}, {"content": {"allowed_attempts": 2, "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "try again", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time", "type": "text"}], "correct_feedback": "Correct", "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "You have 2 tries", "type": "text