secondary_2"}, {"content": "Understands general and detailed information as well as attitude and intention on a wide range of general and work topics, in conversations or presentations, spoken at a natural speed and in circumstances that make it more difficult to hear.", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Understands specific information in written texts about the different social and work contexts.", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Understands general and detailed information as well as attitude and intention on a wide range of general and work topics, in conversations or presentations, spoken at a natural speed and in circumstances that make it more difficult to hear.", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Understands specific information in written texts about the different social and work contexts.", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Understands specific information in written texts about the different social and work contexts.", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Understands specific information in written texts about the different social and work contexts.", "type": "secondary_8"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "The Future Continuous and Future Perfect Tenses", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You use the <span class=\"strong\">Future Continuous tense</span> to talk about something happening at a particular time in the future.<br>You use the <span class=\"strong\">Future Perfect tense</span> to talk about something that will be complete by a certain time in the future. ", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "Look at the chart for information about the<span class=\"strong\"> Future Continuous</span> and <span class=\"strong\">Future Perfect</span> tenses:", "type": "text"}, {"content": "When I finish reading the manual, I will have learned everything I need to know about doing interviews!", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Hopefully, by tomorrow I will have decided what to wear for the first day on the job.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "At the end of the week the committee will have delivered their report.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "I will be going to a few more interviews in the next few weeks.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Next week, my boss will be meeting with me every afternoon.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "The CEO will be chairing the shareholder's meeting tomorrow.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":4,\"columns\":4,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Tense\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Structure\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Note\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Example\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Future Continuous \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"will (not) + be + verb -ing\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"the action will have started before that moment but it will not have finished at that moment\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">The CEO <span class=\\\"strong\\\">will be chairing</span> the shareholder's meeting tomorrow. </span>  \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Future Perfect\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"will + have + past participle\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"you can sometimes think of the <span class=\\\"strong\\\">Future Perfect tense </span>like the<span class=\\\"strong\\\"> Present Perfect tense</span>, but instead of your viewpoint being in the present, it is in the future\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">At the end of the week the committee <span class=\\\"strong\\\">will have delivered</span> their report.</span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "The Future with Will, Going to and the Present Continuous Tenses", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "When you want to talk about the future, but you need to be specific about the circumstances around the event, you can choose from these structures: <span class=\"strong\">will + verb</span>, <span class=\"strong\">be going to +  verb </span>  and the <span class=\"strong\">Present Continuous tense </span> (subject + v-ing). ", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "Take a look at the chart for an outline of when to use these different tenses and an example of each:", "type": "text"}, {"content": " You'll learn about the structure and purpose of the company. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "You'll also see how they set themselves apart from others. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "You'll impress the interviewer if you give some reasons why you want to work there. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "I'm going to do a lot more research before my next interview. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "It's possible you will be doing something quite different in the role.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "I'm going to an interview next week.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":4,\"columns\":3,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"To talk about ...\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Structure to Use:\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Example:\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"decisions made at the time of speaking\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"will + verb\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">You<span class=\\\"strong\\\">'ll learn</span>  about the structure and purpose of the company. </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"intentions\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"be going to + verb \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I<span class=\\\"strong\\\">'m going to do</span>  a lot more research before my next interview. </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"things that are arranged, on the agenda or booked\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Present Continuous\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I<span class=\\\"strong\\\">'m going</span> to an interview next week.</span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "take a long, hard look ", "type": "name"}, {"content": " think about something very carefully", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: You have to take a long hard look at what you have achieved.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn9le13ob09aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": "These are words you use to talk about jobs and careers.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": " tips and tricks", "type": "name"}, {"content": "small things that help you do something better or make something easier", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example:  I've learned a lot of good tips and tricks for doing interviews. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn9le13ob09aud06", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "best-seller ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a publication that is very popular", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I'm not sure your manual would be a best-seller.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn9le13ob09aud05", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "clich\u00e9", "type": "name"}, {"content": "an idea or expression that is not original; that is used very often", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example:  It sounds a bit clich\u00e9, but you really have to know your strengths and weaknesses. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn9le13ob09aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "self-aware", "type": "name"}, {"content": "knowledgeable about yourself, your strengths and weaknesses", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Employers want you to be self-aware. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn9le13ob09aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "misleading", "type": "name"}, {"content": " not representative of the truth", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Some recruiters asked me if I thought the job advertisement was misleading.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn9le13ob09aud04", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to impress ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to make other people think positively of you", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: You'll impress the interviewer if you give some reasons why you want to work there. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn9le13ob09aud07", "type": "audio"}]}, {"content": "engenn9le13ob09re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"content": "Make a list of the tips and tricks for giving a good interview that are mentioned in this lesson. Write them in short form (only 3 - 5 words each).", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Go online. Find more tips. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Add them to the list in short form. Try to find a total of 10 tips.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Read your tips to a partner.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Listen to your partner's tips. 